      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "Pleomorphic adenoma may occur in any site in which there is salivary gland tissue. It has rarely been described arising in the nasal cavity. We report a case of septal pleomorphic adenoma and discuss the clinical presentation and surgical management."},
